# Karina, Shadow Blade

> Karina is less an assassin than a kill-reset engine. Her ultimate resets when the marked target dies, and her passive refunds cooldown on both other skills on every third consecutive hit, which means the moment she catches the first low-HP target the rest of the enemy team is on borrowed time. That only happens if the draft actually gives her a first pick to catch.

