## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Jungle Reset Burst (Jungle)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Starlium Scythe, Genius Wand, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Starlium Scythe, Genius Wand, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Tough Boots over Arcane Boots when Use when the enemy draft has chain crowd control that catches Karina before Shadow Assault can reset.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use when one stasis button is needed to survive the counter-burst after the first dive.; Glowing Wand over Blood Wings when Use when shields or HP regen keep the first reset target alive and the enemy has not stacked heavy Magic Defense.; Immortality over Blood Wings when Use for final Lord fights where a revive is worth more than extra magic power and shield tempo.
- Total cost: 11980 gold

Default ranked jungle setup built around Starlium follow-up damage, Genius Wand shred, and Ice Retribution stickiness for the first reset.

